---

<section id="kontak" class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-[#EFF8F8] border-b border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Field Engineer Showcase -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-sm aspect-[4/5] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-300">
          <img
            src="/images/engineer-team.webp"
            alt="Tim Teknisi Elektrikal dan Mekanikal Gensetora"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top filter brightness-[0.98]"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0A4347]/90 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
          
          <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-[6px] px-5 py-3.5 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200">
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-[#0A4347]">Tim Teknisi Lapangan</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-[#E5A71D] font-bold">Spesialis Elektrikal &amp; Mekanikal Diesel</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Consultation Details & WhatsApp CTA -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-[#0A4347] text-[#F5B82E] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
          Konsultasi Teknis &amp; RFQ
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#0A4347] tracking-normal leading-tight">
          Konsultasikan Kebutuhan Daya Bersama Tim Rekayasa Gensetora
        </h2>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Hindari salah pilih kapasitas yang berisiko membuat genset mati saat beban puncak atau pemborosan anggaran akibat membeli unit berukuran terlalu besar. Tim estimator kami siap menghitung beban aktual dan menerbitkan surat penawaran resmi (RFQ).
        </p>

        <!-- Feature Points -->
        <div class="space-y-3 pt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#0A4347] text-[#F5B82E] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">
              ✓
            </div>
            <span>Perhitungan beban lonjakan starting motor (*surge factor*) dan keseimbangan 3-phase</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#0A4347] text-[#F5B82E] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">
              ✓
            </div>
            <span>Paket rental genset terpadu lengkap kabel power tembaga, tangki solar, dan operator standby</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#0A4347] text-[#F5B82E] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">
              ✓
            </div>
            <span>Survei lokasi tapak (*site inspection*) gratis untuk area operasional Jabodetabek &amp; Jawa Timur</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 items-start sm:items-center">
          <a
            id="btn_consultation_wa"
            href="https://wa.me/6285183005070?text=Halo%20Gensetora,%20saya%20ingin%20konsultasi%20kebutuhan%20genset%20dan%20permintaan%20penawaran%20resmi"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg bg-[#25D366] hover:bg-[#20bd5a] active:scale-95 text-[#063336] font-extrabold text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-wide uppercase shadow-lg transition-[background-color,transform] duration-200"
          >
            <span>Hubungi WhatsApp Tim Estimator (0851-8300-5070)</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#063336]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
